# Business data — these repos are PUBLIC.
# Petpooja exports, stock sheets and anything else carrying real sales,
# customer or supplier detail stays on the machine it was downloaded to.
# Nothing here is a secret in the credential sense; it is the restaurant's
# trading data, and a public repo is not where it lives.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
data/
exports/
uploads/
sales-data/
# Where a scan or export is parked when it has to stay on this machine but
# out of the repo. It holds a real AKIRA stock sheet; nothing in here is ever
# committed.
local/
# Force-add a genuinely needed fixture with `git add -f`, and only after
# checking it carries no customer phone, name or address.

# Real source documents kept on this machine, never in the repo.
# scripts/eval_extractor.py reads the requisition scan from here.
local/
